======================================================================
 🛠️ 2. PROPOSED FEATURE CATEGORIES PER MODEL
======================================================================

### 🌍 Universal Categories (Mandatory for all 4 Models)
Features describing the economic, physical, and general status of the player, regardless of position.
* **Identifiers & Meta-data:** `tm_id`, `player`, `player_positions`, `team`, `team id`, `player id`
* **Economic & Time Value:** `market_value` (Target Variable), `_season_year`, `_league`
* **Age & Experience:** `birth_year`, `age_in_season`
* **Match Volume:** `appearances`, `matchesStarted`, `minutesPlayed`
* **General Performance Evaluation:** `rating`, `countRating`

---

### 🧤 Model 1: Goalkeepers (GK)
* **Goalkeeping Core (Saves & Conceding):** `saves`, `cleanSheet`, `goalsConceded`, `goalsConcededInsideTheBox`, `goalsConcededOutsideTheBox`, `savesCaught`, `savesParried`, `savedShotsFromInsideTheBox`, `savedShotsFromOutsideTheBox`, `goalsPrevented`
* **Box Command:** `highClaims`, `punches`, `runsOut`, `crossesNotClaimed`
* **Penalty Situations:** `penaltyFaced`, `penaltySave`
* **Distribution (Overlap with Defenders):** `accuratePasses`, `accuratePassesPercentage`, `accurateLongBalls`, `accurateLongBallsPercentage`, `goalKicks`, `accurateOwnHalfPasses`, `inaccuratePasses`
* **Critical Errors:** `errorLeadToGoal`, `errorLeadToShot`, `redCards`, `directRedCards`

---

### 🛡️ Model 2: Defenders (DEF - CB, RB, LB, RWB, LWB)
* **Active Defense Core:** `interceptions`, `clearances`, `blockedShots`, `outfielderBlocks`, `ballRecovery`, `possessionWonAttThird`
* **Duels & Physicality:** `aerialDuelsWon`, `aerialDuelsWonPercentage`, `aerialLost`, `groundDuelsWon`, `groundDuelsWonPercentage`, `duelLost`, `dribbledPast`
* **Errors & Discipline:** `errorLeadToGoal`, `errorLeadToShot`, `penaltyConceded`, `ownGoals`, `fouls`, `redCards`, `directRedCards`
* **Build-up Play (Overlap):** `accuratePasses`, `accuratePassesPercentage`, `accurateOwnHalfPasses`, `accurateOppositionHalfPasses`, `accurateLongBalls`, `possessionLost`, `inaccuratePasses`
* **Offensive Contribution (Overlap):** `goals`, `headedGoals`, `assists`, `keyPasses`, `accurateCrosses`, `accurateCrossesPercentage`
* **Custom Engineering Features:** `is_versatile`, `secondary_position`, `number_of_positions`

